{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635490/extras/d559a74657b2c8b80143c51ca2ef2ec4.avif?t=1774005082\" width=1560 height=216 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mine asteroids to extract valuable resources using your trusty Clickaxe, Laser, and other mining gear.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore different mining sites, each with its own anomalies and rare artifacts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire help before missions to multiply your resources and reach deeper and deeper into the asteroid.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635490/extras/4f198de8834c2a01756c65e141ce50dd.poster.avif?t=1774005082\" width=1170 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635490/extras/4f198de8834c2a01756c65e141ce50dd.webm?t=1774005082\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635490/extras/4f198de8834c2a01756c65e141ce50dd.mp4?t=1774005082\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635490/extras/ffade5da33d2a036716c3d8bb8a61347.avif?t=1774005082\" width=1560 height=216 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new mining gear, invest in upgrades and discover rare skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deliver resources back to earth to earn permanent research points.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategize and pick the best synergies in a massive roguelite tech tree.</p></li></u